{
  "_id": 23050,
  "id": "never_forget_her_flame",
  "name": "Never Forget Her Flame",
  "desc": "\"Come, come to me...\"\nA vivid memory, guided by flames, envelops her body and soul.\n\nThe bygone days had fallen into the grave, is that true?\n\"Hush, don't weep, don't resist...\"\nShe brands herself onto others' hearts, as strange gazes gradually turn familiar.\n\"Do you remember now?\"\n\nAs the embers of old memories scatter away, her face carries a trace of intoxicating floral fragrance...\n\"I am your memory.\"",
  "rarity": 5,
  "pathType": "Warlock",
  "pathTypeText": "Nihility",
  "effectName": "Immolation",
  "effectTemplate": "Increases the wearer's Break Effect by <color=#f29e38ff>#1[i]%</color>. When entering combat, increases Break DMG dealt by the wearer and another teammate who triggered combat by <color=#f29e38ff>#2[i]%</color>. If there is no teammate who triggered combat, applies this effect to the wearer and the teammate with the highest Break Effect. Effects of the same type cannot be stacked. When the wearer applies Weakness to an enemy target, recovers 1 Skill Point. This effect can only trigger once. And resets this trigger count when using Ultimate.",
